1
00:00:06,165 --> 00:00:07,998
(All characters, places, and organizations
in this drama are fictitious.)

2
00:00:08,023 --> 00:00:09,698
(Filming followed broadcast guidelines
for minors, some scenes used AI.)

3
00:00:12,902 --> 00:00:14,430
Where are you right now?

4
00:00:17,223 --> 00:00:18,314
Where are you.

5
00:00:23,217 --> 00:00:24,536
I'm sorry.

6
00:00:24,607 --> 00:00:31,088
My brother will come get Gyeol
in the morning.

7
00:00:31,497 --> 00:00:33,477
If you could just send me the address...

8
00:00:33,644 --> 00:00:35,022
Where are you, Gyu Rim?

9
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:42,671
I'm coming right now.

10
00:00:48,036 --> 00:00:50,607
I'm coming to you right now.
Where are you?

11
00:00:59,457 --> 00:01:00,717
Gyu Rim.

12
00:01:05,463 --> 00:01:07,270
Don't come, Mu Jin.

13
00:01:10,643 --> 00:01:11,883
Later.

14
00:01:14,535 --> 00:01:15,908
Some other time...

15
00:01:18,724 --> 00:01:20,709
Please take care of Gyeol.

16
00:01:24,083 --> 00:01:25,416
I'm sorry.

17
00:01:26,517 --> 00:01:28,632
I'm so sorry, Mu Jin.

18
00:01:53,485 --> 00:01:54,670
What's going on?

19
00:01:56,816 --> 00:02:00,611
Why is Gyeol washing his face
in our bathroom?

20
00:02:04,091 --> 00:02:07,952
Hey, I know you own 70 percent
of this place,

21
00:02:08,153 --> 00:02:10,099
but don't I deserve an explanation
as someone who lives here?

22
00:02:11,916 --> 00:02:14,573
Something came up. I'll explain later.

23
00:02:14,598 --> 00:02:17,293
Something what? Explain now, not later.

24
00:02:17,997 --> 00:02:19,133
Jeong Woo.

25
00:02:19,410 --> 00:02:21,073
I'll explain.

26
00:02:26,897 --> 00:02:30,864
There's a secret about how I was born.

27
00:02:34,418 --> 00:02:37,284
That's why I'm staying at Mu Jin's place.

28
00:02:40,997 --> 00:02:42,569
Don't tell me you told the kid everything.

29
00:02:42,594 --> 00:02:45,131
- It's an "I am your father" thing.
- It's nothing like that.

30
00:02:46,117 --> 00:02:47,426
If it's not that, then what?

31
00:02:49,011 --> 00:02:53,318
My mother isn't my real mother.

32
00:02:56,350 --> 00:03:02,033
Gyeol, you don't have to explain
every little thing to him. Okay?

33
00:03:02,903 --> 00:03:04,192
Let's go to the room.

34
00:03:07,186 --> 00:03:08,651
Did you bring lotion?

35
00:03:09,531 --> 00:03:11,114
Want to borrow mine?

36
00:03:13,990 --> 00:03:16,399
Gyu Rim isn't Gyeol's real mother?

37
00:03:16,631 --> 00:03:18,251
Then what about Mu Jin?

38
00:03:19,123 --> 00:03:21,837
Then he isn't Gyeol's father either.

39
00:03:22,758 --> 00:03:25,446
Well, if that isn't news.

40
00:03:27,517 --> 00:03:30,463
I'll be sleeping down here
to catch you if you fall,

41
00:03:30,555 --> 00:03:32,802
so toss all you want. Sleep easy.

42
00:03:32,876 --> 00:03:34,561
Thank you.

43
00:03:35,137 --> 00:03:36,264
Here.

44
00:03:38,957 --> 00:03:42,575
- Do you sleep well in strange places?
- No.

45
00:03:43,897 --> 00:03:46,368
Now what.

46
00:03:47,831 --> 00:03:50,931
Storybooks used to put me right to sleep
when I was little.

47
00:03:51,165 --> 00:03:52,385
Did you bring a storybook?

48
00:03:52,590 --> 00:03:55,015
No. Just my workbook.

49
00:03:55,604 --> 00:03:56,893
Should I read you the workbook?

50
00:03:58,705 --> 00:04:02,685
Right. A workbook isn't exactly
a bedtime story.

51
00:04:04,186 --> 00:04:06,977
- What do we do.
- Sing me a lullaby.

52
00:04:09,431 --> 00:04:11,265
- A lullaby?
- Yes.

53
00:04:11,542 --> 00:04:14,736
I sleep better when my mom sings to me.

54
00:04:14,891 --> 00:04:19,212
She loves you that much,
so why do you keep hurting her?

55
00:04:19,884 --> 00:04:23,508
I don't know. I just keep getting angry.

56
00:04:27,038 --> 00:04:29,611
That's because you love her so much.

57
00:04:35,324 --> 00:04:40,028
I can sing you a lullaby, but
not as well as your mother.

58
00:04:40,789 --> 00:04:42,055
Is that okay?

59
00:04:43,512 --> 00:04:46,583
- It's okay.
- All right, then.

60
00:04:56,190 --> 00:05:01,344
<i>Sleep now my little one</i>

61
00:05:03,017 --> 00:05:08,224
<i>Out in the fields and hills</i>

62
00:05:10,017 --> 00:05:15,501
<i>The birds and the little lambs</i>

63
00:05:17,157 --> 00:05:22,883
<i>Have all gone to sleep</i>

64
00:05:24,804 --> 00:05:30,099
<i>The moon at the window</i>

65
00:05:32,031 --> 00:05:38,256
<i>Sends beads of silver and gold</i>

66
00:05:39,956 --> 00:05:45,004
<i>Down through this quiet night</i>

67
00:05:49,751 --> 00:05:55,716
<i>Sleep now my little one</i>

68
00:06:11,050 --> 00:06:13,498
You're hungry, right? Hold on a bit.

69
00:06:17,124 --> 00:06:18,341
What are you doing?

70
00:06:19,377 --> 00:06:21,125
I texted my mom.

71
00:06:21,150 --> 00:06:23,288
That I'm staying at your place
for a while.

72
00:06:23,417 --> 00:06:25,912
For a while? Longer?

73
00:06:26,933 --> 00:06:28,206
You're staying on?

74
00:06:28,637 --> 00:06:30,049
That's not okay?

75
00:06:31,284 --> 00:06:33,027
Of course it's okay.

76
00:06:33,686 --> 00:06:35,820
Of course. Why wouldn't it be.

77
00:06:43,669 --> 00:06:46,883
Ma'am, until I've sorted out my thoughts,

78
00:06:47,377 --> 00:06:49,577
I'm going to stay at Mu Jin's for a while.

79
00:06:56,585 --> 00:06:57,917
Gyu Rim, I'm coming in.

80
00:07:08,266 --> 00:07:10,077
- Gyu O.
- Ma'am,

81
00:07:10,274 --> 00:07:13,742
until I've sorted out my thoughts,
I'm staying at Mu Jin's for a while?

82
00:07:16,396 --> 00:07:17,624
Give me my phone.

83
00:07:22,004 --> 00:07:23,654
Should I go drag the brat back?

84
00:07:24,191 --> 00:07:26,508
Forget it.
He said he'd come when he's ready.

85
00:07:26,578 --> 00:07:29,525
When is that? He's barely knee-high.

86
00:07:29,613 --> 00:07:31,706
He'll come back once you
have withered away.

87
00:07:31,731 --> 00:07:35,047
- Han Gyu O.
- I've had it. What kind of punk is he?

88
00:07:35,704 --> 00:07:38,468
Calling his own mother ma'am.

89
00:07:39,183 --> 00:07:40,947
I ought to just...

90
00:07:41,173 --> 00:07:42,584
Just what?

91
00:07:44,231 --> 00:07:47,331
If words won't work, use a stick.

92
00:07:47,990 --> 00:07:49,364
Don't we have one in the house?

93
00:07:49,631 --> 00:07:50,911
Should I go find one?

94
00:07:51,284 --> 00:07:54,628
You're the one overreacting here.

95
00:07:54,884 --> 00:07:56,478
Why would you hit a child?

96
00:07:57,284 --> 00:07:59,404
He's already having a hard time.
Don't you dare lay a hand on him.

97
00:07:59,811 --> 00:08:01,674
Just try touching one hair
on Gyeol's head.

98
00:08:02,291 --> 00:08:04,206
I'll break your wrist first.

99
00:08:04,231 --> 00:08:09,612
It kills me to see you falling apart
like this over him.

100
00:08:09,677 --> 00:08:11,971
What is that punk even worth?

101
00:08:14,197 --> 00:08:17,209
You think you get the last word?

102
00:08:17,330 --> 00:08:19,532
You want to know what he's worth?

103
00:08:22,598 --> 00:08:24,998
He's my child. What about it?

104
00:08:26,664 --> 00:08:30,456
He's my son. Dearer to me than my life.

105
00:08:31,004 --> 00:08:35,598
I wouldn't trade him for a thousand
of you. That's my boy.

106
00:08:35,964 --> 00:08:37,051
What about it.

107
00:08:38,043 --> 00:08:41,393
Fine. Let's be honest now, Gyu Rim.

108
00:08:41,678 --> 00:08:43,248
You said Gyeol isn't your son.

109
00:08:44,051 --> 00:08:45,828
You said you didn't give birth to him.

110
00:08:46,644 --> 00:08:48,756
Why raise a kid you didn't even have?

111
00:08:48,930 --> 00:08:51,353
What were you thinking?

112
00:08:52,017 --> 00:08:54,586
Dad, Han Gyu Yeong, me, the twins.

113
00:08:54,846 --> 00:08:57,020
All of us blocking your way forward.

114
00:08:57,251 --> 00:08:59,066
Weren't we enough for you?

115
00:09:08,697 --> 00:09:13,315
I never begged any of you for a thing.

116
00:09:14,563 --> 00:09:19,401
I never once asked you to carry him,
to fix him a bottle,

117
00:09:20,781 --> 00:09:25,841
or to change a single diaper.

118
00:09:27,671 --> 00:09:31,096
I raised him. I raised my Gyeol.

119
00:09:31,951 --> 00:09:37,105
I carried him on my back to my shifts
and raised him myself.

120
00:09:38,664 --> 00:09:41,937
So keep your mouth shut.

121
00:09:43,970 --> 00:09:48,524
Nobody says a word about me
or about Gyeol.

122
00:09:49,237 --> 00:09:51,188
Every one of you, shut your mouths,

123
00:09:53,624 --> 00:09:55,098
and don't make a sound.

124
00:10:31,851 --> 00:10:36,650
Hold the twist and stretch
your left arm past your ear.

125
00:10:36,918 --> 00:10:39,292
Can you really eat right now?

126
00:10:40,110 --> 00:10:43,568
If I stepped into that,
the police would have to come.

127
00:10:44,350 --> 00:10:47,415
Han Gyu Rim's turned into a total thug.

128
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:50,622
She nearly broke my nose
hitting me yesterday.

129
00:10:51,540 --> 00:10:53,482
She hit you too? Why?

130
00:10:55,070 --> 00:10:57,062
You must have done something
to deserve it.

131
00:10:57,891 --> 00:11:00,460
Is that why you got smacked just now?

132
00:11:00,824 --> 00:11:03,770
Yes. I completely deserved it.

133
00:11:04,290 --> 00:11:07,006
- Lucky she didn't kill me.
- Whatever.

134
00:11:07,963 --> 00:11:11,173
What parent doesn't lose it
when someone insults their kid?

135
00:11:12,458 --> 00:11:15,913
Hey, he's not even her kid.

136
00:11:16,184 --> 00:11:17,641
You said Gyu Rim didn't give birth to him.

137
00:11:21,891 --> 00:11:22,967
Why the glare?

138
00:11:22,992 --> 00:11:25,528
I'm only repeating what you said.

139
00:11:26,643 --> 00:11:28,107
I've got a question.

140
00:11:28,871 --> 00:11:30,346
What does a child mean to you, Dad?

141
00:11:32,870 --> 00:11:35,813
Why is the arrow pointed at me again?

142
00:11:35,838 --> 00:11:38,320
Am I the easy target here?

143
00:11:40,871 --> 00:11:42,311
Pick a side, would you.

144
00:11:42,336 --> 00:11:44,916
Back your sister up or take her on.

145
00:11:44,941 --> 00:11:46,126
My point exactly.

146
00:11:53,070 --> 00:11:55,672
Why are you two glaring at me now?

147
00:11:56,057 --> 00:11:57,862
Am I the easy target for you too?

148
00:11:58,283 --> 00:11:59,481
Why did you do it?

149
00:12:00,024 --> 00:12:01,308
Do what?

150
00:12:01,603 --> 00:12:06,094
When Gyeol was little and asked you
to play with him,

151
00:12:06,195 --> 00:12:09,575
you never took him on a bike ride,
wouldn't let him call you Grandpa,

152
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:11,542
wouldn't let him say hello in public.

153
00:12:12,319 --> 00:12:16,339
I wasn't old enough to be called Grandpa,

154
00:12:16,650 --> 00:12:21,053
and hearing it made me feel
like my life was over.

155
00:12:21,078 --> 00:12:23,143
Should he call you Grandma instead?

156
00:12:23,384 --> 00:12:24,526
Or big brother?

157
00:12:24,557 --> 00:12:26,837
Won't even let him say the word Grandpa.

158
00:12:27,070 --> 00:12:28,553
What is Gyeol, Hong Gil Dong?

159
00:12:28,704 --> 00:12:32,238
Hong Gil Dong couldn't call
his father Dad.

160
00:12:33,637 --> 00:12:35,762
That was on a test.
Didn't want you getting it wrong.

161
00:12:35,787 --> 00:12:37,148
Aren't you something.

162
00:12:39,594 --> 00:12:42,454
Wait until you have children of your own.

163
00:12:42,601 --> 00:12:47,501
A daughter like a flower, not married,
no husband, having a baby alone,

164
00:12:47,601 --> 00:12:52,501
and that little thing blocking the road
ahead of my own child like a bulldozer,

165
00:12:54,001 --> 00:12:58,434
how precious would that fatherless
burden look to you?

166
00:12:58,501 --> 00:13:01,419
So a woman who isn't married
shouldn't have a baby?

167
00:13:01,501 --> 00:13:05,101
Of course she can. Nothing wrong with it.

168
00:13:05,601 --> 00:13:07,868
On her own she could have ten of them,

169
00:13:07,893 --> 00:13:11,493
but she shouldn't shame the family
she's living with.

170
00:13:11,834 --> 00:13:14,134
Gyu Rim and Gyeol never shamed me.

171
00:13:14,634 --> 00:13:15,701
Me neither.

172
00:13:16,543 --> 00:13:18,976
Like father, like children.

173
00:13:19,001 --> 00:13:21,276
That we're a family ground up
in a high-powered blender,

174
00:13:21,301 --> 00:13:25,101
that people point and whisper about us,
you've heard it all too.

175
00:13:26,734 --> 00:13:28,601
Me again?

176
00:13:28,901 --> 00:13:31,442
Am I the root of everything again?

177
00:13:31,701 --> 00:13:36,101
Anyway, anyone who messes with Gyu Rim
or Gyeol answers to me from now on.

178
00:13:36,625 --> 00:13:38,680
Why? Are you going to hit me too?

179
00:13:39,034 --> 00:13:41,634
Yes, if you've got it coming.

180
00:13:42,168 --> 00:13:43,468
So watch yourself from now on.

181
00:13:43,701 --> 00:13:46,176
- Han Gyu Seo, have you lost your mind?
- Hey.

182
00:13:46,201 --> 00:13:48,301
You'll deal with me first.

183
00:13:48,734 --> 00:13:50,301
Anyone who messes with Gyu Rim and Gyeol,

184
00:13:50,334 --> 00:13:53,401
I'll tear them apart before Gyu Seo does,
so keep that in mind.

185
00:13:53,947 --> 00:13:56,342
The two of you, seriously.

186
00:13:56,367 --> 00:13:58,517
Terrifying. How will I survive?

187
00:13:58,701 --> 00:14:01,601
Dad, you had children
and raised a couple of gangsters?

188
00:14:01,734 --> 00:14:05,434
Yes, fine.

189
00:14:06,334 --> 00:14:09,976
It's all my fault. Every bit of it.

190
00:14:10,001 --> 00:14:14,472
Hey.

191
00:14:14,834 --> 00:14:20,201
If you resent me that much,
let's meet again in the next life.

192
00:14:20,434 --> 00:14:23,801
You two be the parents next time.

193
00:14:24,442 --> 00:14:28,432
Let's see if children get born
and raised however you please.

194
00:14:28,457 --> 00:14:30,776
Let's trade places and find out.

195
00:14:30,801 --> 00:14:32,401
- Are you crazy?
- Why would I?

196
00:14:32,434 --> 00:14:33,601
- No thanks.
- No thanks.

197
00:14:33,901 --> 00:14:37,101
How do the three of you say no
in perfect sync like that?

198
00:14:37,401 --> 00:14:39,758
- You hate me that much?
- Yes.

199
00:14:40,901 --> 00:14:42,552
You little...

200
00:14:43,460 --> 00:14:44,527
Would you rather we said yes?

201
00:14:50,495 --> 00:14:52,328
- My head.
- What is this?

202
00:14:58,307 --> 00:15:00,549
What? Doesn't it taste good?

203
00:15:01,474 --> 00:15:03,674
No, it's good.

204
00:15:04,501 --> 00:15:07,834
I just can't seem to eat.

205
00:15:09,034 --> 00:15:12,759
You feel bad about that text
you sent your mom. That's why.

206
00:15:13,134 --> 00:15:15,501
Chew it well
so you don't get an upset stomach.

207
00:15:16,140 --> 00:15:17,485
Drink your juice too.

208
00:15:24,101 --> 00:15:27,234
By the way, where's the tall guy
with the small eyes?

209
00:15:27,554 --> 00:15:30,353
Who? Jeong Woo?

210
00:15:30,801 --> 00:15:32,734
He left early, sulking.

211
00:15:35,701 --> 00:15:39,834
You watch out too. Old habits die hard.

212
00:15:40,101 --> 00:15:42,701
What'll you do if you grow up
to be like Jeong Woo?

213
00:15:42,734 --> 00:15:45,034
That tall and that thin-skinned.

214
00:15:45,418 --> 00:15:49,376
He wasn't sulking. He's just very honest.

215
00:15:49,401 --> 00:15:52,902
Yeah? Honest, okay.

216
00:15:53,201 --> 00:15:55,301
Then can I be a little honest
with you too?

217
00:15:55,501 --> 00:15:56,534
Yes.

218
00:15:57,134 --> 00:15:59,876
- You know I like your mom, right?
- Yes.

219
00:16:00,334 --> 00:16:03,609
The way you're so cold to her, honestly,

220
00:16:03,634 --> 00:16:05,556
I don't like it one bit.

221
00:16:06,476 --> 00:16:09,576
What am I supposed to do
when my heart won't listen to me?

222
00:16:09,601 --> 00:16:12,758
Then scold your heart. Tell it no.

223
00:16:13,034 --> 00:16:16,463
Anyone else, maybe, but not your mother.

224
00:16:16,701 --> 00:16:20,540
Your mother is a good, kind person.
Not even you get to do that to her.

225
00:16:24,134 --> 00:16:28,271
That must have hurt, Gyu O. I'm sorry.

226
00:16:45,742 --> 00:16:47,401
I've got this. Go back inside.

227
00:16:48,101 --> 00:16:49,603
No school today?

228
00:16:50,074 --> 00:16:51,391
It's Saturday.

229
00:16:55,034 --> 00:16:57,701
Sorry about this morning. For the scene.

230
00:16:57,734 --> 00:16:59,601
Still, how could you slap him?

231
00:17:02,434 --> 00:17:04,401
How could you only slap one cheek?

232
00:17:04,801 --> 00:17:07,458
You should have gotten both of them.

233
00:17:07,801 --> 00:17:09,734
So he'd never dare make a sound again.

234
00:17:16,093 --> 00:17:17,860
All you did was swell up your own hand.

235
00:17:19,234 --> 00:17:21,707
Next time Han Gyu O needs hitting,
just tell me.

236
00:17:22,101 --> 00:17:24,353
My fist is a hundred times stronger.

237
00:17:26,734 --> 00:17:30,469
You miss Mom too, don't you?

238
00:17:32,901 --> 00:17:35,886
How did you get through it
when you missed her, Gyu Seo?

239
00:17:37,401 --> 00:17:41,345
I never missed her. I had you.

240
00:17:41,801 --> 00:17:43,334
You're all I need.

241
00:17:45,201 --> 00:17:46,551
I mean it.

242
00:17:49,540 --> 00:17:53,599
I'll do this, so go study.

243
00:17:53,701 --> 00:17:56,201
You can't end up ignorant like me, got it?

244
00:17:58,501 --> 00:18:01,434
Want to go eat ribs? My treat.

245
00:18:01,834 --> 00:18:03,945
I've got enough to buy you ribs.

246
00:18:04,501 --> 00:18:06,666
I'm busy. Go on, I said.

247
00:18:07,434 --> 00:18:10,015
Eat well to hold out, hold out to win,
Gyu Rim.

248
00:18:10,601 --> 00:18:12,309
If you burn through all your energy,

249
00:18:12,334 --> 00:18:14,601
what strength will you have left
to hold Gyeol when he comes back?

250
00:18:15,101 --> 00:18:19,820
Squeeze that little guy so hard he pops.

251
00:18:20,334 --> 00:18:22,022
So let's go eat ribs.

252
00:18:22,094 --> 00:18:23,827
I'll clear it with Su Nam.

253
00:18:24,087 --> 00:18:25,687
All right, later.

254
00:18:25,769 --> 00:18:28,116
Let go. People are watching.

255
00:18:28,141 --> 00:18:30,441
I'm not letting go until you say
you'll go eat ribs.

256
00:18:31,136 --> 00:18:33,201
I know a famous rib place.

257
00:18:33,226 --> 00:18:37,027
Why are you so stubborn?
I'm really busy today.

258
00:18:37,507 --> 00:18:39,504
I'll help with everything after we eat.

259
00:18:39,601 --> 00:18:41,514
I'm good at peeling onions
and cutting radish.

260
00:18:41,734 --> 00:18:44,401
- Fine. Let go and talk, Han Gyu Seo.
- I'm sorry.

261
00:18:44,426 --> 00:18:46,193
- That hurts. Let go.
- I was awful.

262
00:18:46,218 --> 00:18:47,913
- Let's go eat.
- Let go.

263
00:19:02,377 --> 00:19:04,941
- What are you doing?
- Quiet.

264
00:19:05,534 --> 00:19:07,601
Not a word. You'll bring bad luck.

265
00:19:11,234 --> 00:19:13,006
What did some fortune teller
say this time?

266
00:19:14,301 --> 00:19:15,688
Seriously.

267
00:19:16,201 --> 00:19:18,934
I told you to stop wasting your time.

268
00:19:19,843 --> 00:19:21,447
You rotten boy, really.

269
00:19:21,734 --> 00:19:24,718
I'd have to be desperate to do this.

270
00:19:25,134 --> 00:19:28,034
Do you know how much you cost me
when you bled this place dry?

271
00:19:28,101 --> 00:19:30,201
I'll pay you back for it, all right?

272
00:19:33,701 --> 00:19:36,901
Nonsense. Listen to you talking garbage.

273
00:19:41,834 --> 00:19:43,601
Take it.

274
00:19:48,967 --> 00:19:51,434
Why is it so light?

275
00:19:52,201 --> 00:19:55,862
Did you think it only cost fifty dollars?

276
00:20:03,401 --> 00:20:05,834
Ten thousand? A hundred thousand?

277
00:20:06,101 --> 00:20:09,401
Including the penalties on the wedding
and the honeymoon,

278
00:20:09,434 --> 00:20:11,601
that's the settlement money you paid
to get me out, right?

279
00:20:11,647 --> 00:20:15,909
Where did all this money come from?

280
00:20:15,934 --> 00:20:20,001
It's what I saved by not buying
and not spending all this time.

281
00:20:21,001 --> 00:20:24,826
Driving for people, delivering packages,
hauling bricks,

282
00:20:25,168 --> 00:20:31,406
catching shrimp, catching crayfish,
catching whales, not whales, anyway...

283
00:20:33,801 --> 00:20:37,258
The check isn't fake.
You really can't trust your own son?

284
00:20:45,574 --> 00:20:47,841
That's my boy.

285
00:20:48,201 --> 00:20:51,470
How did you save this much?

286
00:20:52,733 --> 00:20:56,634
Right.
What does it matter how you earned it.

287
00:20:57,501 --> 00:21:00,434
Earn it like a dog, spend it like a king.

288
00:21:00,761 --> 00:21:06,961
No job is beneath anyone. You did well.

289
00:21:07,134 --> 00:21:10,733
- Right? I knew you'd be proud.
- Sure.

290
00:21:11,534 --> 00:21:15,168
Proud, my foot, you rotten boy.

291
00:21:15,834 --> 00:21:21,513
Money you bled for, and you blow it
in one shot? You rotten boy.

292
00:21:21,734 --> 00:21:26,063
One careless punch and look
what came down on us.

293
00:21:26,434 --> 00:21:28,815
And you're fine with that?

294
00:21:29,301 --> 00:21:34,922
Seeing this money has my heart
pounding again after it stopped.

295
00:21:35,301 --> 00:21:38,509
Anyway, we're square now,

296
00:21:38,534 --> 00:21:43,501
so never tell me again
what a fortune teller or a fairy said.

297
00:21:47,001 --> 00:21:49,501
Then I'll only listen to
the fortune teller at Gyeryongsan.

298
00:21:49,534 --> 00:21:51,134
- Mom.
- Right.

299
00:21:52,001 --> 00:21:57,201
There was a camera in the very back
of your drawer,

300
00:21:57,834 --> 00:21:59,934
so I smashed it to pieces.

301
00:22:01,989 --> 00:22:05,762
Yeah? Good. Nice work.

302
00:22:05,801 --> 00:22:09,748
But why was a camera in there?

303
00:22:09,901 --> 00:22:13,170
Didn't I tell you to stay away
from cameras?

304
00:22:13,314 --> 00:22:16,114
Why would that be there?

305
00:22:16,601 --> 00:22:19,801
I don't even eat curry to stay away
from anything starting with C.

306
00:22:19,834 --> 00:22:22,701
You just want to see me dead,
you rotten boy.

307
00:22:22,801 --> 00:22:27,409
Go near a camera again and I'll cut you
out of this family. You rotten boy.

308
00:22:27,434 --> 00:22:30,076
- It isn't mine. I don't know.
- What don't you know?

309
00:22:30,101 --> 00:22:32,001
- I don't know.
- Who put it there?

310
00:22:32,061 --> 00:22:33,627
Who put it there?
Did a thief leave it there?

311
00:22:33,673 --> 00:22:34,707
I don't know.

312
00:22:56,701 --> 00:22:58,434
All right, let's take ten and come back.

313
00:23:07,501 --> 00:23:10,854
There you are, our artist.

314
00:23:10,901 --> 00:23:14,046
Let go. I'm not in the mood.

315
00:23:15,201 --> 00:23:17,401
What's wrong? Did something happen?

316
00:23:18,401 --> 00:23:21,141
The more I say, the worse I feel.
Never mind.

317
00:23:21,368 --> 00:23:23,201
Anything happen at the company?

318
00:23:23,501 --> 00:23:26,001
Of course something happened.

319
00:23:26,601 --> 00:23:29,301
Everyone wants to collaborate with us...

320
00:23:29,495 --> 00:23:33,462
Seoksam Trading, Jewang Textiles,
Duseom, GL Fashion...

321
00:23:33,487 --> 00:23:37,587
From names everyone knows
right down to the small ones,

322
00:23:37,901 --> 00:23:39,801
we're booked solid.

323
00:23:39,901 --> 00:23:42,686
I think we're about to blow up.

324
00:23:43,101 --> 00:23:46,834
Yesterday a director from Ring Bio came,

325
00:23:46,901 --> 00:23:49,101
said she wouldn't leave
without meeting you,

326
00:23:49,234 --> 00:23:51,901
and ordered black bean noodles
outside your office.

327
00:23:52,434 --> 00:23:54,601
She's got a bit of a screw loose...

328
00:23:55,761 --> 00:23:58,671
I looked over her proposal and mood board.

329
00:23:59,434 --> 00:24:01,534
The feel of it was pretty good.

330
00:24:02,001 --> 00:24:04,813
That good? Let me see the mood board.

331
00:24:20,061 --> 00:24:21,061
What is it?

332
00:24:25,027 --> 00:24:26,782
Look at this kid. He's something.

333
00:24:30,701 --> 00:24:33,487
Set up a meeting with this company.

334
00:24:34,301 --> 00:24:37,179
Their director is extremely impatient.

335
00:24:37,501 --> 00:24:39,201
If I say the word she'll be out here now.

336
00:24:39,401 --> 00:24:41,034
Then tell her to come right now.

337
00:24:41,461 --> 00:24:42,494
Really?

338
00:24:58,628 --> 00:25:00,956
Ms. Kim Yun Jin from Ring Bio?

339
00:25:03,660 --> 00:25:06,812
- You're the artist Joel, right?
- Yes.

340
00:25:08,201 --> 00:25:12,529
Good to meet you. I'm Kim Yun Jin.

341
00:25:13,934 --> 00:25:17,701
You ordered black bean noodles
just to meet me?

342
00:25:18,101 --> 00:25:21,476
Yes. The noodles in that neighborhood
are excellent.

343
00:25:21,501 --> 00:25:23,701
Sorry to put you through that.

344
00:25:23,988 --> 00:25:27,580
I've got restless feet. I'm not built
to sit in an office.

345
00:25:28,853 --> 00:25:31,020
Then I got very lucky.

346
00:25:49,534 --> 00:25:51,295
All right. Let's work together.

347
00:25:52,301 --> 00:25:57,214
You're deciding right here,
just like that?

348
00:25:57,701 --> 00:25:58,701
Yes.

349
00:25:59,101 --> 00:26:03,701
A little shop like mine
up against Dongyun, what's left to weigh?

350
00:26:07,301 --> 00:26:12,434
Getting to you was so hard that I expected
someone picky and difficult,

351
00:26:12,734 --> 00:26:15,801
but are you really all right deciding
this easily?

352
00:26:16,134 --> 00:26:17,134
Yes.

353
00:26:18,601 --> 00:26:23,796
Work out the details and schedule
with my manager.

354
00:26:25,201 --> 00:26:27,934
We're done here, so I'll head out first.

355
00:26:30,101 --> 00:26:31,101
All right.

356
00:26:39,801 --> 00:26:42,300
So there's someone more impatient than me.

357
00:26:49,701 --> 00:26:51,334
Honestly...

358
00:27:04,801 --> 00:27:07,797
Why is that girl sitting there.
She startled me.

359
00:27:08,674 --> 00:27:12,574
He's wearing that. I saw it at the Paris
show earlier this year.

360
00:27:12,599 --> 00:27:14,071
Don't change the subject.

361
00:27:14,934 --> 00:27:16,402
So?

362
00:27:17,169 --> 00:27:19,149
So what are you going to do?

363
00:27:21,001 --> 00:27:24,701
Call off this wedding?

364
00:27:26,901 --> 00:27:29,591
I went by the district office
and registered the marriage.

365
00:27:30,234 --> 00:27:32,401
Seong Uk just stamped it and I went alone.

366
00:27:33,401 --> 00:27:35,601
You registered the marriage?

367
00:27:35,801 --> 00:27:40,280
Yes. We're husband and wife now,
and I'm your daughter-in-law.

368
00:27:42,101 --> 00:27:44,701
Please treat me kindly from now on,
Mother.

369
00:27:44,801 --> 00:27:48,326
So you've forgiven Seong Uk?

370
00:27:48,634 --> 00:27:51,520
No, I haven't forgiven him yet,

371
00:27:51,547 --> 00:27:53,947
but I love him too much
to walk away over this.

372
00:27:54,301 --> 00:27:57,363
I'll make him mine and rebuild him
into something like new.

373
00:27:57,401 --> 00:28:03,316
Gyu Yeong, how did you get so wonderful?

374
00:28:03,906 --> 00:28:06,473
Then what about the wedding?

375
00:28:06,601 --> 00:28:08,101
There won't be a wedding.

376
00:28:08,901 --> 00:28:12,501
Tell everyone we donated the wedding
budget to those in need.

377
00:28:12,734 --> 00:28:14,301
That's our story, Mother.

378
00:28:15,634 --> 00:28:20,486
How did your parents raise you
to be this sharp...

379
00:28:22,201 --> 00:28:25,218
Do they know about Seong Uk?

380
00:28:25,514 --> 00:28:27,747
It would be a disaster if they did.

381
00:28:28,001 --> 00:28:30,662
I just told them we're skipping
the ceremony and honeymoon,

382
00:28:30,687 --> 00:28:34,477
and putting the money
toward those in need.

383
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:39,171
What luck, getting a daughter-in-law
like this in my old age.

384
00:28:40,314 --> 00:28:43,242
Give me your hand.

385
00:28:46,834 --> 00:28:49,266
This is five carats.

386
00:28:50,001 --> 00:28:52,870
It's Bvlgari. Take it.

387
00:28:53,580 --> 00:28:56,478
Mother, how could I wear something
so expensive?

388
00:28:58,534 --> 00:29:01,591
Take it and forgive Seong Uk.

389
00:29:02,294 --> 00:29:07,927
He isn't like that. Some vixen got to him
and he lost his head for a moment.

390
00:29:08,101 --> 00:29:12,909
He's my son, but he's so pure, so clear...

391
00:29:14,334 --> 00:29:19,425
Pure as a blank sheet of paper...
Never mind. My stomach...

392
00:29:21,034 --> 00:29:24,301
Excuse me. The restroom for a moment.

393
00:29:26,607 --> 00:29:29,091
- Go ahead.
- Yes.

394
00:29:34,381 --> 00:29:35,881
Next time give me a house, Mother.

395
00:29:36,041 --> 00:29:40,098
A building, a golf membership,
land, a vacation home.

396
00:29:40,287 --> 00:29:44,220
I'll play the vixen in every category,
so give me all of it.

397
00:29:50,094 --> 00:29:51,394
My baby.

398
00:30:05,001 --> 00:30:08,035
The money you promised,
how soon can it be?

399
00:30:08,334 --> 00:30:10,755
Ji Yeol's surgery date is coming up...

400
00:30:10,962 --> 00:30:13,816
Bringing this up over and over is hard
on me too.

401
00:30:14,401 --> 00:30:16,701
Please take care of it soon.

402
00:30:40,167 --> 00:30:41,634
You said you had no family.

403
00:30:48,834 --> 00:30:51,899
I'll take care of you for life.

404
00:30:52,834 --> 00:30:54,701
Until I've put you back the way you were.

405
00:31:11,001 --> 00:31:12,934
I just pulled cash out of the bank.

406
00:31:13,801 --> 00:31:15,134
To buy Han Gyu O.

407
00:31:16,034 --> 00:31:17,501
Where do I go? How do I buy you?

408
00:31:18,834 --> 00:31:20,401
Insane.

409
00:31:26,387 --> 00:31:27,540
Don't you know me?

410
00:31:28,061 --> 00:31:30,728
Han Gyu O. You really don't remember?

411
00:31:31,634 --> 00:31:34,501
No. I wiped it all clean.

412
00:31:35,201 --> 00:31:38,801
So please pretend not to know me
too, Gyeol's uncle.

413
00:31:39,401 --> 00:31:40,901
Even if we happen to meet again.

414
00:32:17,361 --> 00:32:20,631
I was terrified you'd call me crazy
and hang up on me.

415
00:32:21,934 --> 00:32:25,101
Which hotel? One you go to a lot.

416
00:32:27,301 --> 00:32:30,401
You're paying, so pick somewhere
you like and book it.

417
00:32:32,201 --> 00:32:34,901
Let me catch my breath. What's the rush?

418
00:32:40,901 --> 00:32:44,253
What I want from you is dating.
Sweet, ordinary dating.

419
00:32:44,834 --> 00:32:49,134
The kind where I tell the world
someone like you is my boyfriend.

420
00:32:50,787 --> 00:32:52,179
I'm not dating you.

421
00:32:54,241 --> 00:32:55,798
But I'm the one with the money.

422
00:32:57,201 --> 00:32:59,808
What I want to buy isn't your body.
It's your soul.

423
00:33:03,601 --> 00:33:06,234
And lose that sour face.

424
00:33:07,001 --> 00:33:09,781
No need to make it so obvious
you only came for the money.

425
00:33:09,981 --> 00:33:11,681
You'll hurt the person holding it.

426
00:33:15,501 --> 00:33:19,234
Fine. Use me however you want,

427
00:33:19,634 --> 00:33:24,112
but I'm telling you now,
I'm never giving you my heart.

428
00:33:25,101 --> 00:33:28,001
Don't tell me in advance. You never know.

429
00:33:28,730 --> 00:33:32,777
I'm telling you in advance that I can't
stand your type.

430
00:33:45,410 --> 00:33:47,890
My man. Day one starts today.

431
00:33:52,344 --> 00:33:54,704
I knew you'd call. It's been a while.

432
00:33:54,729 --> 00:33:57,924
What's with your photo?
Are you really dating Han Gyu O?

433
00:33:58,544 --> 00:34:00,737
We didn't agree to date. We're dating.

434
00:34:00,970 --> 00:34:03,263
Can't a teacher even read one line?

435
00:34:03,937 --> 00:34:05,210
Day one starts today.

436
00:34:05,377 --> 00:34:06,923
Have you lost your mind?

437
00:34:08,057 --> 00:34:11,370
Nobody falls in love in their right mind.

438
00:34:12,110 --> 00:34:13,743
Are you with Han Gyu O right now?

439
00:34:13,877 --> 00:34:17,583
Of course. My boyfriend hates being
apart from me for a second.

440
00:34:17,817 --> 00:34:19,150
Where are you?

441
00:34:19,177 --> 00:34:21,797
Why? Think I'm lying?

442
00:34:21,831 --> 00:34:23,597
Where?

443
00:34:38,036 --> 00:34:39,176
Why did you lie?

444
00:34:42,137 --> 00:34:43,464
I didn't lie.

445
00:34:44,030 --> 00:34:45,750
He stepped out to take a call.

446
00:34:47,757 --> 00:34:49,870
I didn't tell Han Gyu O you were coming.

447
00:34:51,110 --> 00:34:53,610
How do I prove it to you?

448
00:34:55,037 --> 00:34:57,350
Should I kiss him right in front of you?

449
00:35:01,017 --> 00:35:03,663
- Hey!
- You piece of trash.

450
00:35:14,930 --> 00:35:18,550
Honey, this girl has lost her mind!

451
00:35:24,103 --> 00:35:26,670
Where are you going? Han Gyu O!

452
00:35:26,810 --> 00:35:28,836
I said where are you going!

453
00:35:39,477 --> 00:35:42,714
Hey, what are you, a grade schooler
at an amusement park?

454
00:35:43,141 --> 00:35:45,090
You wanted to come look at a river?

455
00:35:45,370 --> 00:35:49,084
I really liked it last time we came.

456
00:35:52,030 --> 00:35:54,419
We have a lot in common.

457
00:35:54,914 --> 00:35:55,943
Don't we?

458
00:35:57,517 --> 00:35:59,295
- Mu Jin.
- Yes.

459
00:36:00,269 --> 00:36:04,496
Are you by any chance my dad?

460
00:36:09,184 --> 00:36:10,197
No.

461
00:36:27,257 --> 00:36:28,877
What are you thinking about?

462
00:36:30,543 --> 00:36:32,029
The same thing you are.

463
00:36:34,430 --> 00:36:36,970
You were thinking about my mom too?

464
00:36:38,157 --> 00:36:40,217
Why? Am I not allowed?

465
00:36:40,930 --> 00:36:44,156
You really do like my mom.

466
00:36:48,543 --> 00:36:50,583
Since when?

467
00:36:50,676 --> 00:36:52,403
Since before you were born.

468
00:36:53,237 --> 00:36:57,023
You've liked her from before I was born
right up to now?

469
00:36:57,337 --> 00:36:58,783
That's a secret, kid.

470
00:36:59,297 --> 00:37:00,983
That's not fair.

471
00:37:01,096 --> 00:37:04,948
I told you everything about me
without leaving anything out.

472
00:37:08,757 --> 00:37:11,997
I'll keep your secret. Man to man.

473
00:37:26,004 --> 00:37:29,330
From the day we met nine years ago
until now,

474
00:37:32,796 --> 00:37:36,843
I haven't stopped for a single minute.

475
00:37:43,148 --> 00:37:44,288
What?

476
00:37:47,063 --> 00:37:48,076
Is that lame?

477
00:37:51,916 --> 00:37:54,642
The things I end up telling you.

478
00:37:54,937 --> 00:37:56,690
Get up. Let's go home.

479
00:37:57,057 --> 00:37:58,790
We're going now?

480
00:37:59,596 --> 00:38:03,576
I'm afraid you'll get everything
out of me. And I'm hungry.

481
00:38:03,716 --> 00:38:05,971
I'll make you carbonara.

482
00:38:05,996 --> 00:38:08,927
Not carbonara. Seafood tomato.

483
00:38:09,137 --> 00:38:12,457
All right. Seafood tomato pasta. Let's go.

484
00:38:22,516 --> 00:38:23,670
Why aren't you answering?

485
00:38:23,804 --> 00:38:26,484
I can't answer yet.

486
00:38:26,710 --> 00:38:28,823
Your mom will worry if you don't.

487
00:38:29,937 --> 00:38:34,037
Could you answer for me and tell her
I'm doing fine?

488
00:38:34,726 --> 00:38:38,073
- Gyeol.
- I need the bathroom.

489
00:38:44,596 --> 00:38:46,919
(Mom)

490
00:38:49,278 --> 00:38:50,980
Gyeol, it's Mom.

491
00:38:51,240 --> 00:38:53,337
Thank you for picking up.

492
00:38:53,362 --> 00:38:55,195
Thank you so much, Gyeol.

493
00:38:56,149 --> 00:38:59,836
I just called because I missed you.

494
00:39:00,476 --> 00:39:04,103
If you're not ready to talk, don't.
I'll do the talking.

495
00:39:04,371 --> 00:39:06,283
Gyeol, have you eaten?

496
00:39:06,757 --> 00:39:08,437
What did you have?

497
00:39:09,096 --> 00:39:11,185
Did he make you something good?

498
00:39:11,383 --> 00:39:12,409
How about sleep?

499
00:39:13,004 --> 00:39:15,631
You can't sleep without
your comfort pillow...

500
00:39:15,726 --> 00:39:17,371
Did you sleep well?

501
00:39:18,652 --> 00:39:20,237
Gyeol, I'm sorry.

502
00:39:20,337 --> 00:39:24,070
I said you didn't have to talk
and then I only asked questions.

503
00:39:25,718 --> 00:39:26,924
I'm sorry.

504
00:39:27,777 --> 00:39:29,670
I'm so sorry, Gyeol.

505
00:39:34,077 --> 00:39:37,283
Gyeol had to run to the bathroom.

506
00:39:39,204 --> 00:39:44,196
He's eating well, sleeping well,

507
00:39:45,299 --> 00:39:47,146
and doing better than you'd think.

508
00:39:48,376 --> 00:39:50,949
This morning we had omelet rice,

509
00:39:51,323 --> 00:39:53,619
and this afternoon we went out,

510
00:39:53,913 --> 00:39:55,911
and had spicy chicken
and buckwheat noodles.

511
00:39:56,592 --> 00:40:01,150
Tonight he asked for seafood tomato pasta,
so I'm making that.

512
00:40:03,902 --> 00:40:05,552
About that comfort pillow.

513
00:40:05,577 --> 00:40:08,897
He slept badly the first night without it,

514
00:40:11,964 --> 00:40:16,534
but I sang him a lullaby and he was out
in twenty minutes,

515
00:40:16,717 --> 00:40:19,518
and apart from getting up once
at 3 a.m. to pee,

516
00:40:19,979 --> 00:40:22,579
he slept straight through until 8 a.m.

517
00:40:23,951 --> 00:40:26,772
But he didn't bring anything
except his toothbrush,

518
00:40:26,846 --> 00:40:29,390
so I was wondering
if I should hit a department store.

519
00:40:29,571 --> 00:40:33,937
A change of clothes, underwear,
socks, pajamas...

520
00:40:34,917 --> 00:40:36,344
What else is there.

521
00:40:37,197 --> 00:40:40,771
A child's spoon and bowl, a storybook.

522
00:40:42,077 --> 00:40:43,503
What else?

523
00:40:44,730 --> 00:40:47,758
Anyway, I'll come by your place later,
so could you pack some of that?

524
00:40:58,424 --> 00:41:01,154
We'll stop by your mom's on the way home.

525
00:41:02,236 --> 00:41:04,649
You can't go to school in my clothes.

526
00:41:05,137 --> 00:41:07,388
Want to try? I'm a little curious.

527
00:41:07,617 --> 00:41:08,624
No.

528
00:41:09,710 --> 00:41:13,906
I asked her to pack you clothes,
pajamas, underwear, socks,

529
00:41:14,550 --> 00:41:17,503
and that comfort pillow.

530
00:41:19,330 --> 00:41:20,463
Okay.

531
00:41:59,243 --> 00:42:01,288
Gyeol fell asleep a little while ago.

532
00:42:02,481 --> 00:42:03,554
Here.

533
00:42:06,622 --> 00:42:08,319
This is Gyeol's step stool.

534
00:42:08,344 --> 00:42:10,504
For brushing his teeth and washing up.

535
00:42:42,590 --> 00:42:43,970
Should I wake him?

536
00:42:45,243 --> 00:42:46,396
No.

537
00:42:49,137 --> 00:42:53,061
I'm sorry Gyeol is keeping you
from your work.

538
00:42:53,970 --> 00:42:57,259
It's fine. All I ever see
is Jeong Woo's sour face,

539
00:42:57,284 --> 00:43:00,424
so having Gyeol around is actually fun.

540
00:43:03,950 --> 00:43:05,009
I'll go.

541
00:43:07,217 --> 00:43:10,363
Thank you. Go on.

542
00:43:20,483 --> 00:43:26,921
Honesty isn't always the right answer,
I know,

543
00:43:27,675 --> 00:43:31,322
and for some people it can hurt
and even feel like violence,

544
00:43:32,355 --> 00:43:35,082
but I think it beats lying and running.

545
00:43:37,984 --> 00:43:39,271
Don't be afraid.

546
00:43:45,470 --> 00:43:47,678
And if it gets too scary, tell me.

547
00:43:48,051 --> 00:43:49,957
I'll do everything I can to help.

548
00:43:55,064 --> 00:43:56,434
I'm really going now.

549
00:44:16,627 --> 00:44:18,420
(Min Ju)

550
00:44:29,997 --> 00:44:31,831
(Seo Min Ju)

551
00:44:41,570 --> 00:44:43,097
Let's talk now.

552
00:44:45,064 --> 00:44:46,090
Go ahead.

553
00:44:47,304 --> 00:44:50,477
Want to explain this insane situation?

554
00:44:51,217 --> 00:44:53,503
I think you're the one who owes
an explanation.

555
00:44:58,363 --> 00:45:00,289
How can you be dating Seo Min Ju?

556
00:45:00,451 --> 00:45:02,144
Don't you know who she is?

557
00:45:02,237 --> 00:45:06,036
She's Su Chan's girlfriend
and my best friend.

558
00:45:07,690 --> 00:45:08,703
And?

559
00:45:09,464 --> 00:45:10,770
"And?"

560
00:45:11,724 --> 00:45:13,771
You said you wiped me from your memory.

561
00:45:14,117 --> 00:45:16,463
You said we'd be strangers.

562
00:45:16,764 --> 00:45:19,438
So what does it matter who I see?

563
00:45:20,523 --> 00:45:24,732
You don't want me, but you can't stand
anyone else having me.

564
00:45:24,932 --> 00:45:26,484
Is that why?

565
00:45:26,923 --> 00:45:30,329
Is that why you threw coffee
and made that trashy scene?

566
00:45:30,550 --> 00:45:32,283
Are you desperate for a woman?

567
00:45:32,444 --> 00:45:33,937
You can't live without one?

568
00:45:33,983 --> 00:45:38,310
No matter how desperate, Seo Min Ju?

569
00:45:38,436 --> 00:45:39,963
Are you lonely these days?

570
00:45:40,217 --> 00:45:43,890
Then go grab any woman off the street
and ask her out.

571
00:45:44,283 --> 00:45:45,349
Should I?

572
00:45:45,703 --> 00:45:46,917
"Should I?"

573
00:45:46,942 --> 00:45:48,229
I'll consider it.

574
00:45:51,837 --> 00:45:54,848
So stop caring who I see,

575
00:45:54,873 --> 00:45:58,191
and stop playing games with people.

576
00:46:02,443 --> 00:46:05,530
Hey! Don't you feel bad for Su Chan?

577
00:46:05,591 --> 00:46:07,541
Is that all your friendship is worth?

578
00:46:07,566 --> 00:46:09,049
Are you trash?

579
00:46:09,242 --> 00:46:10,771
Yes, I'm trash,

580
00:46:11,533 --> 00:46:13,470
and I don't care
if it's Seo Min Ju or anyone.

581
00:46:13,495 --> 00:46:15,641
- Hey, Han Gyu O.
- If it isn't Kwon Hui Na,

582
00:46:17,377 --> 00:46:19,021
then it doesn't matter who it is.

583
00:46:20,541 --> 00:46:21,631
Satisfied?

584
00:47:14,690 --> 00:47:16,303
Do you have any idea...

585
00:47:17,797 --> 00:47:21,223
what you're doing to me and Seo Hyeon?

586
00:47:22,783 --> 00:47:26,036
I know this isn't the best way.

587
00:47:26,304 --> 00:47:29,304
If it isn't, then think of another one.

588
00:47:29,329 --> 00:47:31,657
This is the worst possible way.

589
00:47:31,682 --> 00:47:34,984
So first let's get Seo Hyeon home,
and after that,

590
00:47:35,556 --> 00:47:37,277
I'll think of another way.

591
00:47:37,302 --> 00:47:39,542
So I just stay a coward?

592
00:47:40,431 --> 00:47:42,945
Hiding behind you, staying petty,

593
00:47:43,245 --> 00:47:46,705
staying shameless, staying brazen?

594
00:47:46,730 --> 00:47:48,947
That's not what I meant.

595
00:47:51,188 --> 00:47:53,603
All right, I'm sorry.

596
00:47:53,717 --> 00:47:57,067
I'm so sorry for judging and deciding
all of it by myself.

597
00:47:58,264 --> 00:48:00,857
What do you have to be sorry for?

598
00:48:01,103 --> 00:48:02,890
I'm the one who's sorry.

599
00:48:05,650 --> 00:48:08,114
To you, and to Seo Hyeon,

600
00:48:08,850 --> 00:48:12,303
so sorry I can't lift my head.

601
00:48:12,328 --> 00:48:18,226
Honey, how many times do I have to say
it isn't your fault?

602
00:48:18,811 --> 00:48:21,386
If I say Gyu Rim is my daughter,

603
00:48:22,013 --> 00:48:24,829
will Seo Hyeon really never see me again?

604
00:48:26,070 --> 00:48:28,743
Will she never forgive me?

605
00:48:28,797 --> 00:48:32,944
Because I'm not her real mother?

606
00:48:32,969 --> 00:48:33,982
Honey.

607
00:48:36,190 --> 00:48:39,003
Just one year. Give it one year.

608
00:48:39,370 --> 00:48:41,324
In that time Seo Hyeon might...

609
00:48:41,491 --> 00:48:45,091
forget Mu Jin completely and love
someone else, and if she does,

610
00:48:45,116 --> 00:48:47,579
then we can tell her everything as it is.

611
00:48:47,604 --> 00:48:49,690
So just one year.

612
00:48:49,731 --> 00:48:52,984
And if her heart hasn't changed
after a year?

613
00:48:53,197 --> 00:48:56,225
Will you keep living outside this house?

614
00:48:59,056 --> 00:49:02,629
How is any of this happening.

615
00:49:04,878 --> 00:49:06,001
Honey.

616
00:49:13,817 --> 00:49:15,431
I thought you'd already left.

617
00:49:22,808 --> 00:49:23,997
Seo Hyeon.

618
00:49:26,650 --> 00:49:28,914
Your mother hasn't eaten anything today.

619
00:49:29,871 --> 00:49:31,167
Just so you know.

620
00:50:04,984 --> 00:50:06,132
Mom.

621
00:50:15,511 --> 00:50:16,849
Are you angry with me?

622
00:50:25,951 --> 00:50:28,753
Are you angry that I drove Dad out?

623
00:50:40,177 --> 00:50:41,995
You can't forgive him.

624
00:50:44,317 --> 00:50:47,264
- I said you can't forgive him.
- Seo Hyeon.

625
00:50:47,430 --> 00:50:50,730
If you forgive him easily and let this go
like nothing happened,

626
00:50:50,925 --> 00:50:52,276
I won't see you either.

627
00:51:03,025 --> 00:51:07,338
You're too soft and too gentle,
Ko Yun Hui.

628
00:51:10,004 --> 00:51:11,772
But not this time.

629
00:51:12,353 --> 00:51:13,813
Not this time.

630
00:51:14,711 --> 00:51:16,338
You know what I mean, don't you?

631
00:51:36,198 --> 00:51:43,110
Look at you, having a love for the ages.

632
00:51:44,671 --> 00:51:47,384
I really need to find a new bar.

633
00:51:47,444 --> 00:51:49,144
I told you not to come. Why are you here?

634
00:51:49,337 --> 00:51:52,430
How do I watch a show this good
over the phone?

635
00:51:53,237 --> 00:51:54,760
- On the rocks.
- Yes.

636
00:51:56,784 --> 00:51:59,941
What kind of comedy is this?

637
00:52:00,204 --> 00:52:03,138
I'm so tired of laughing I could throw up.

638
00:52:06,661 --> 00:52:10,560
Hey, this is your punishment.

639
00:52:11,463 --> 00:52:15,370
For turning me down forty years ago.

640
00:52:18,791 --> 00:52:21,096
You don't remember, do you.

641
00:52:21,664 --> 00:52:25,084
If you'd accepted my proposal back then,

642
00:52:25,109 --> 00:52:28,388
Mu Jin really could have been your son.

643
00:52:31,524 --> 00:52:33,869
That wasn't forty years ago.
It was thirty-six.

644
00:52:33,964 --> 00:52:35,304
So you do remember.

645
00:52:38,651 --> 00:52:42,179
After you turned me down, I was furious,

646
00:52:42,810 --> 00:52:47,051
so I married the man my parents picked.
Without any love.

647
00:52:49,824 --> 00:52:51,311
Let's get the facts straight.

648
00:52:51,877 --> 00:52:53,137
That was no proposal.

649
00:52:53,237 --> 00:52:56,679
You got drunk and harassed me all night.
Remember now?

650
00:52:57,098 --> 00:52:59,618
Go home. Wash up and go to bed.

651
00:52:59,951 --> 00:53:04,691
Since we're both here,
should the two of us remarry?

652
00:53:05,064 --> 00:53:06,311
It'd be your third.

653
00:53:06,417 --> 00:53:08,877
That puts me at a loss.

654
00:53:11,791 --> 00:53:14,907
Not even a laugh.
I came here to make you laugh.

655
00:53:21,157 --> 00:53:24,125
Fine, forget it.

656
00:53:24,577 --> 00:53:27,225
You're in no mood to laugh.

657
00:53:41,218 --> 00:53:42,404
Hey.

658
00:53:44,097 --> 00:53:47,088
I said laugh, not laugh that hard.

659
00:53:47,970 --> 00:53:49,821
People are staring. Hey!

660
00:53:51,198 --> 00:53:52,596
That Mu Jin is my...

661
00:53:56,030 --> 00:53:57,577
It's absurd.

662
00:53:59,964 --> 00:54:01,463
How does this make any sense?

663
00:54:03,577 --> 00:54:05,044
Hey.

664
00:54:07,964 --> 00:54:09,199
Are you crying?

665
00:54:10,883 --> 00:54:13,757
Think how hard this is on Yun Hui.

666
00:54:15,510 --> 00:54:17,735
I said I'd handle everything,
and now this.

667
00:54:20,364 --> 00:54:23,610
She must be so lost
and cornered right now.

668
00:54:25,637 --> 00:54:27,581
Unbelievable.

669
00:54:30,011 --> 00:54:34,424
You really are having a love for the ages.

670
00:54:36,143 --> 00:54:37,357
Go on, get out.

671
00:54:52,628 --> 00:54:56,050
How did you draw this so well?

672
00:54:56,850 --> 00:54:58,596
You're a Picasso, Gyeol.

673
00:55:06,337 --> 00:55:07,746
Yes, hello?

674
00:55:12,294 --> 00:55:13,590
Gyu Min.

675
00:55:14,171 --> 00:55:18,677
Mu Jin. Did you ask her?

676
00:55:20,311 --> 00:55:25,006
I keep wondering whether the babies
were switched at the hospital.

677
00:55:25,290 --> 00:55:27,776
No. I didn't ask.

678
00:55:28,891 --> 00:55:30,478
When are you going to ask?

679
00:55:32,277 --> 00:55:33,337
I'm not sure.

680
00:55:35,044 --> 00:55:36,224
What if...

681
00:55:38,224 --> 00:55:40,211
What if Gyeol really was switched?

682
00:55:41,964 --> 00:55:42,991
I'm not sure.

683
00:55:43,570 --> 00:55:45,171
Then do we switch them back?

684
00:55:46,357 --> 00:55:51,223
Do we return them to their birth
parents like in a TV show?

685
00:55:52,044 --> 00:55:53,524
That's going a bit far.

686
00:55:54,204 --> 00:55:56,891
Things like that rarely happen
in real life.

687
00:55:56,916 --> 00:55:58,593
They do happen.

688
00:55:59,301 --> 00:56:01,114
I saw it on the news.

689
00:56:02,571 --> 00:56:05,150
Gyu Min, I'm with Gyeol right now.

690
00:56:06,693 --> 00:56:09,180
Okay. I'll hang up.

691
00:56:09,499 --> 00:56:11,651
- Sure.
- Mu Jin.

692
00:56:12,451 --> 00:56:13,451
Yes.

693
00:56:17,434 --> 00:56:21,098
If she really did give birth,

694
00:56:21,529 --> 00:56:23,644
and Gyeol was switched at the hospital,

695
00:56:25,442 --> 00:56:27,360
then what will you do?

696
00:56:31,710 --> 00:56:35,426
Gyeol is calling me, so I should go.
Talk later.

697
00:56:44,010 --> 00:56:46,071
You rotten boy, hand it over.

698
00:56:46,096 --> 00:56:47,244
Bring it here.

699
00:56:47,269 --> 00:56:49,071
Then sign a pledge.

700
00:56:49,284 --> 00:56:53,294
A pledge that you won't throw Gyu Rim's
family out and will let them stay.

701
00:56:54,155 --> 00:56:56,477
You spineless, gutless boy.

702
00:56:56,502 --> 00:57:01,382
Those women in that family
have wrecked your life together,

703
00:57:01,498 --> 00:57:05,319
and you gave them your heart, your love,
your money,

704
00:57:05,447 --> 00:57:10,097
and they made a complete fool
of a perfectly good man.

705
00:57:10,364 --> 00:57:13,558
How are you not furious about any of it?

706
00:57:13,583 --> 00:57:16,071
It doesn't bother me.

707
00:57:16,728 --> 00:57:20,881
Money comes and goes, and nobody dies
for lack of it.

708
00:57:20,967 --> 00:57:24,186
Gyu Yeong didn't put me up to it,
and Gyu Rim didn't dump me.

709
00:57:24,211 --> 00:57:26,004
I dumped her.
I've said it a hundred times.

710
00:57:26,029 --> 00:57:29,547
Listen to you. Such a big heart.

711
00:57:29,901 --> 00:57:33,268
Instead of hiking all the way
into the mountains,

712
00:57:33,501 --> 00:57:37,724
I could just come to you, couldn't I?

713
00:57:38,191 --> 00:57:42,477
My one and only son,
worse to me than an enemy,

714
00:57:42,521 --> 00:57:47,010
I can't kill him and I can't save him.
What do I do?

715
00:57:48,638 --> 00:57:50,914
You foolish woman,

716
00:57:51,064 --> 00:57:53,579
your son's word is my word,

717
00:57:53,604 --> 00:57:59,411
so sign the pledge he asks for
and stop hounding poor Gyu Rim.

718
00:57:59,624 --> 00:58:02,061
You good-for-nothing boy, honestly.

719
00:58:02,086 --> 00:58:03,262
Where should I put this?

720
00:58:03,324 --> 00:58:06,803
Where will people see it best
and spread it fastest?

721
00:58:07,951 --> 00:58:09,067
Right here.

722
00:58:09,092 --> 00:58:10,454
Lee Guk.

723
00:58:10,517 --> 00:58:13,152
Where are you going with that?

724
00:58:13,177 --> 00:58:15,191
Hey.
Your shop is the neighborhood hangout.

725
00:58:15,216 --> 00:58:17,704
All the women in the area hang out here?

726
00:58:17,729 --> 00:58:19,564
Yes, that's true, but...

727
00:58:19,589 --> 00:58:22,626
What for? What if it is the hangout?

728
00:58:22,651 --> 00:58:25,564
Put this up in your shop for me.

729
00:58:25,589 --> 00:58:28,784
You want to bury me here?

730
00:58:28,809 --> 00:58:30,944
Where should it go. Right there.

731
00:58:30,969 --> 00:58:32,711
That spot's the most visible.

732
00:58:32,736 --> 00:58:35,091
Heung Sik!

733
00:58:35,116 --> 00:58:36,170
Let go!

734
00:58:36,195 --> 00:58:37,331
- My son...
- Lee Guk!

735
00:58:46,884 --> 00:58:52,747
Honesty isn't always the right answer,

736
00:58:53,851 --> 00:58:57,257
and for some people it can hurt
and even feel like violence,

737
00:58:58,711 --> 00:59:02,845
but I think it beats lying and running.
Don't be afraid.

738
00:59:10,996 --> 00:59:14,399
Study hard and build up skills.

739
00:59:14,663 --> 00:59:15,844
That's right, isn't it?

740
00:59:17,910 --> 00:59:20,379
You've gotten every one right so far.

741
00:59:21,464 --> 00:59:23,463
You really are smart, Gyeol.

742
00:59:24,078 --> 00:59:26,397
I used to be great at this too.

743
00:59:31,071 --> 00:59:32,866
I'm just saying.

744
00:59:34,210 --> 00:59:35,423
Next question, please.

745
00:59:37,630 --> 00:59:40,837
Want something to drink? Soy milk?

746
00:59:41,737 --> 00:59:44,601
No thanks. I already brushed my teeth.

747
00:59:47,847 --> 00:59:51,610
Put this over here separately...

748
00:59:52,804 --> 00:59:53,915
You've got a text, Gyeol.

749
00:59:54,004 --> 00:59:55,484
Mine's in the room.

750
00:59:56,531 --> 00:59:59,964
Separately, and then together.

751
01:00:02,638 --> 01:00:05,024
Mu Jin, I'm outside.

752
01:00:05,091 --> 01:00:06,628
Can we talk for a minute?

753
01:00:10,284 --> 01:00:13,545
Gyeol, I'm stepping out for a bit.
Keep working.

754
01:00:13,957 --> 01:00:15,369
Jeong Woo will be here soon.

755
01:00:15,850 --> 01:00:21,044
Sure. Don't mind me
and go do what you need to.

756
01:00:21,344 --> 01:00:24,171
Just pretend I'm not here.

757
01:00:26,904 --> 01:00:27,964
All right.

758
01:00:31,990 --> 01:00:35,291
This is it. The one that's separate...

759
01:00:44,144 --> 01:00:45,161
Han Gyu Rim.

760
01:00:51,491 --> 01:00:53,164
Gyeol's doing his worksheets.

761
01:00:53,724 --> 01:00:56,110
Jeong Woo will be here soon,
so try not to worry.

762
01:01:01,809 --> 01:01:03,141
Want to go to a coffee shop?

763
01:01:03,974 --> 01:01:06,934
No. Let's talk here.

764
01:01:43,817 --> 01:01:48,822
I can wait all night,

765
01:01:50,214 --> 01:01:52,429
so take your time.

766
01:01:59,397 --> 01:02:00,624
Gyeol.

767
01:02:03,444 --> 01:02:06,388
He isn't the child I gave birth to.

768
01:02:11,277 --> 01:02:12,791
He's my friend's son.

769
01:02:15,518 --> 01:02:17,680
My friend wasn't able to raise him,

770
01:02:20,111 --> 01:02:23,167
so I did. My Gyeol.

771
01:02:28,464 --> 01:02:31,163
You told me to face things honestly,

772
01:02:33,724 --> 01:02:37,746
so I'm going to tell Gyeol the truth.

773
01:02:42,251 --> 01:02:44,021
But I'm a little scared.

774
01:02:45,587 --> 01:02:49,768
Honestly, not a little.

775
01:02:53,231 --> 01:02:54,808
I'm terrified.

776
01:03:14,674 --> 01:03:16,942
Let's get something to drink.

777
01:03:17,757 --> 01:03:19,033
I'm so thirsty.

778
01:03:52,224 --> 01:03:53,369
You did well.

779
01:03:55,251 --> 01:03:56,430
That's the right call.

780
01:03:59,372 --> 01:04:05,138
Gyeol is smart and thoughtful.
He'll understand.

781
01:04:13,468 --> 01:04:15,748
And if he does struggle with it,

782
01:04:17,021 --> 01:04:20,520
I'll be right there doing my best too.

783
01:04:25,024 --> 01:04:26,071
Thank you.

784
01:04:29,577 --> 01:04:31,805
I came from work, so I have to go back.

785
01:04:32,752 --> 01:04:34,112
I'll go.

786
01:04:37,947 --> 01:04:39,210
Where is your child?

787
01:04:51,150 --> 01:04:52,408
Where is our child,

788
01:04:57,790 --> 01:05:02,431
the one you gave birth to?

789
01:05:37,581 --> 01:05:39,701
(Love on the Menu)

790
01:05:39,744 --> 01:05:43,064
Mu Jin is dying to come see you right now.

791
01:05:43,089 --> 01:05:44,444
I miss my mom.

792
01:05:44,659 --> 01:05:47,458
I miss her, but I don't want to.

793
01:05:47,483 --> 01:05:50,153
Your father lied because of me.

794
01:05:50,464 --> 01:05:53,117
Why did you leave me behind
eight years ago?

795
01:05:53,142 --> 01:05:54,484
I never ran away.

796
01:05:54,824 --> 01:05:55,931
You're the one who ran.

797
01:05:55,956 --> 01:05:57,817
If you're going to leave, please leave.

798
01:05:57,842 --> 01:05:59,177
And take the children with you.

799
01:05:59,431 --> 01:06:02,597
There's someone Gyu Rim must not meet.

800
01:06:03,031 --> 01:06:06,184
Should the three of us go somewhere
nobody knows us?

801
01:06:07,372 --> 01:06:09,272
Dramaday.me
